Source: ce100g2-switch
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: CE100G2Driver project <root@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ce100g2-switch-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, ethtool, iproute2, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Description: CE100G2 X553 and Marvell 88E6190 switch drivers
 Board-specific glue connecting the Intel X553 MDIO bus to Linux's upstream
 mv88e6xxx DSA driver, plus an Ubuntu ixgbe build fixing the X553 2.5G PCS,
 for Trend Micro Cloud Edge CE100G2 and matching Lanner NCA-2011 appliances.
